flowchart TD
    accTitle: Opportunity workflow with a policy-driven application handoff
    accDescr: Seven forward-only phases. Exact artifact checks and all independent approvals precede one application handoff. Existing private policy can auto-clear it; only required decisions or personal attestations need a human. A new per-role browser session completes and submits the application once, respecting tool confirmations and access barriers.
    subgraph DISCOVERY["PHASE 1: Discovery"]
      direction TB
      H1["1. YOU: Set priorities or share leads"]:::human
      subgraph SCOUTS["Configured scouting skills"]
        S["2. Find leads within authorized scope"]
        V["3. Verify full live JD; deduplicate;<br/>map evidence and confirmed answers"]
        S --> V
      end
      HF["3a. YOU: Supply a missing fact<br/>or resolve a conflicting preference"]:::human
      H1 --> S
      V -. Only if needed .-> HF
      HF -. Resolve within Discovery .-> V
    end
    subgraph QUALIFICATION["PHASE 2: Qualification"]
      direction TB
      R["4. Score exact evidence using configured rubric;<br/>obtain independent reviews"]
      Q["5. Gate: configured threshold<br/>and required reviewers approve"]
      P["5a. Otherwise park or hold here;<br/>resolve disagreements within this phase"]:::hold
      R --> Q
      Q -. Not cleared .-> P
    end
    subgraph PUBLICATION["PHASE 3: Publication"]
      direction TB
      G["6. Check shared-route stops,<br/>applications and reservations"]
      J["7. Save qualified JD privately;<br/>verify builder handoff packet"]
      GP["6a. Unknown or stopped: hold here"]:::hold
      G -->|Clear| J
      G -. Not cleared .-> GP
    end
    subgraph BUILD["PHASE 4: Resume build"]
      subgraph BUILD_SKILL["Configured resume customization skill"]
        B["8. Build one package from approved evidence<br/>and the chosen master layout"]
      end
    end
    subgraph REVIEW["PHASE 5: Resume review"]
      direction TB
      subgraph REVIEW_SKILL["Customization contract + review guidance"]
        C["9. Validate exact PDF;<br/>ALL configured independent reviewers approve<br/>this artifact with verified receipts"]
        W["9a. In review: checks or reviewers pending<br/>Not blocked, approved or application-ready"]:::pending
        X["9b. Blocked: missing or failed checks;<br/>fix and recheck inside this phase"]:::hold
        C -. Pending .-> W
        W -. Finish reviews .-> C
        C -. Missing, unknown or failed .-> X
        X -. Recheck .-> C
      end
    end
    subgraph HANDOFF["PHASE 6: Application handoff"]
      direction TB
      D["10. Dashboard links exact PDF and receipts<br/>Score or visual impression never clears the handoff"]
      H["11. One application-only handoff gate<br/>Exact validated PDF + ALL verified independent approvals;<br/>route stops, reservations and duplicates clear;<br/>configured authorization + required personal attestations<br/>Auto-cleared: existing policy<br/>Ready: required decision recorded"]
      HD["11a. Waiting on you: ONLY a policy-required decision<br/>for this exact PDF and application,<br/>or a missing personal attestation"]:::human
      HP["11b. In review: required checks pending<br/>No application handoff yet"]:::pending
      HX["11c. Blocked: missing, unknown, failed or changed<br/>Fix and revalidate the exact artifact here;<br/>never infer consent from absent receipts"]:::hold
      D --> H
      H -. New decision or attestation required .-> HD
      HD -. Record once for exact artifact and scope; recheck .-> H
      H -. Pending .-> HP
      HP -. Finish checks .-> H
      H -. Not cleared or revisions .-> HX
      HX -. Revalidate and recheck .-> H
    end
    subgraph APPLICATION["PHASE 7: Application"]
      direction TB
      subgraph APPLICATION_SKILL["Configured browser application skill"]
        A12["12. NEW per-role browser application session<br/>Separate from the resume builder"]
        A13["13. Recheck live role, route stops,<br/>reservations and prior applications"]
        A14["14. Complete form with applicable confirmed answers<br/>Use only the exact approved PDF"]
        A15["15. Required pre-submit review of actual form and PDF<br/>Respect tool confirmations and access barriers"]
        A16["16. Submit once with current application authorization<br/>No outreach, profile edits or unrelated uploads"]
        A17["17. Verify site confirmation and record receipt privately<br/>No confirmation: hold and reconcile, never blind retry"]
        AH["13a. Blocked: stopped, unknown, duplicate or access barrier<br/>Resolve within this session before proceeding"]:::hold
        AQ["14a. YOU: Missing personal attestation<br/>or required tool confirmation only"]:::human
        A12 --> A13
        A13 -->|Clear| A14
        A13 -. Not cleared .-> AH
        AH -. Resolve and recheck .-> A13
        A14 --> A15
        A14 -. Missing personal attestation .-> AQ
        A15 -. Required tool confirmation .-> AQ
        AQ -. Record applicable answer; recheck .-> A13
        A15 -. Corrections; revalidate exact artifact and approvals .-> A14
        A15 -->|All requirements satisfied| A16
        A16 --> A17
        A17 -. Unverified outcome; reconcile before any retry .-> AH
      end
    end
    DISCOVERY -->|AUTO CLEARED: verified JD and evidence| QUALIFICATION
    QUALIFICATION -->|AUTO CLEARED: score + exact approval| PUBLICATION
    PUBLICATION -->|AUTO CLEARED: route checks + handoff| BUILD
    BUILD -->|AUTO CLEARED: draft available| REVIEW
    REVIEW -->|AUTO CLEARED: exact checks + ALL verified approvals| HANDOFF
    H -->|Handoff cleared; no repeat approval| A12
    classDef human fill:#fff0c2,stroke:#8a5900,color:#332100,stroke-width:2px
    classDef hold fill:#ffe4e6,stroke:#b4233b,color:#591323
    classDef pending fill:#fff7db,stroke:#805500,color:#493100
    style DISCOVERY fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style QUALIFICATION fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style PUBLICATION fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style BUILD fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style REVIEW fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style HANDOFF fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style APPLICATION fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#365781,stroke-width:2px
    style SCOUTS fill:#edf4ff,stroke:#67758b,stroke-dasharray:6 4
    style BUILD_SKILL fill:#edf4ff,stroke:#67758b,stroke-dasharray:6 4
    style REVIEW_SKILL fill:#edf4ff,stroke:#67758b,stroke-dasharray:6 4
    style APPLICATION_SKILL fill:#edf4ff,stroke:#67758b,stroke-dasharray:6 4
